WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.059 --> 00:00:09.820
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:09.821 --> 00:00:13.257
What do they see?

3
00:00:13.258 --> 00:00:17.687
They see a toy store.

4
00:00:17.688 --> 00:00:23.554
The blobs go inside.

5
00:00:23.555 --> 00:00:48.341
They play with a train set.

6
00:00:48.342 --> 00:01:02.918
They play with building toys.

7
00:01:02.919 --> 00:01:20.791
They play with robots.

8
00:01:20.792 --> 00:01:37.685
They play with dolls.

9
00:01:37.686 --> 00:02:06.571
They play with board games.

10
00:02:06.572 --> 00:02:23.600
They play with Frisbees.

11
00:02:23.601 --> 00:02:28.694
Blobs, what are you doing now?

12
00:02:28.695 --> 00:02:48.941
That's not a toy.

13
00:02:48.942 --> 00:02:52.054
Silly blobs!

14
00:02:52.055 --> 00:02:55.914
Good-bye!

